Points + Normal (Directed)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88f29491-ec17-42de-9a09-a11e9902a1e1)\n\n- Check the 'EmissionNormalTexture' field in the particle process material, and see that no texture was generated/assigned to this field.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/29e8d17f-f04f-4c16-bcd6-feb87263bcb4)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[EmissionTextureNormal_notCreateable.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20037298/EmissionTextureNormal_notCreateable.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106092/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}